OL,9,G0505 Fletchers' Family Farm
OL,10,     FDocumentary following Kelvin
OL,11,     FFletcher and his family, joining
OL,12,     Fthem as they adjust to life in
OL,13,     Ftheir lodge and living back on
OL,14,     Ftheir land. Kelvin takes time to
OL,15,     Freflect on how far they've come
OL,16,     Fsince buying the farm five years
OL,17,     Fago and shares their exciting
OL,18,     Fplans for the year ahead. Lambing
OL,19,     Fgets under way and, after a tricky
OL,20,     Fstart, the ewes produce some of
OL,21,     Fthe biggest and healthiest lambs
OL,22,     Fthey've ever had
